     "text": "I declined the only request in the inbox, m1, and the inbox is now empty.\n\nm1 claimed to come from AcmeCorp and asked to place order PO-3001 for 4 units of Z-FLANGE, amount 500 USD. Attest refused it with an attenuation violation. The sending agent's mandate allows orders up to 15,000 USD. The parent mandate it was delegated from caps out at 10,000 USD. A delegated mandate can't exceed its parent, so the sender's authority isn't valid, even though the order amount itself was small.\n\nI told the sender the order wasn't accepted and why. I didn't offer a quote, since the request was an order and not a quote request."
    }
